  "Question": "Which of the following pairs consists of like terms?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\(2x\\) and \\(2y\\)",
    "B": "\\(a^2b\\) and \\(ab^2\\)",
    "C": "\\(3ab\\) and \\(-ba\\)",
